msgid "Header row with columns: %s. Name a stored credential; never put a password in the file. Every row must be valid or nothing is imported."
msgstr "Umurongo w'umutwe ufite inkingi: %s. Vuga izina ry'umwirondoro wo kwinjira wabitswe; ntugashyire ijambobanga mu idosiye. Buri murongo ugomba kuba wemewe bitabaye ibyo nta kintu cyinjizwa."

