#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "Host name or IP address of the BMC, without https:// or a path."
msgstr "Izina rya mudasobwa cyangwa aderesi ya IP ya BMC, nta https:// cyangwa inzira birimo."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "Do not verify is logged when set and shown as a warning on the health page while it stays."
msgstr "Kutagenzura byandikwa mu nyandiko-mvugo iyo bihiswemo kandi bikerekanwa nk'umuburo ku rupapuro rw'ubuzima igihe cyose bikiriho."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "CA Bundle File"
msgstr "Idosiye y'ishami rya CA"

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "For the CA bundle mode: absolute path on the poller to a PEM file that others cannot write."
msgstr "Ku buryo bw'ishami rya CA: inzira yuzuye kuri poller igana ku idosiye ya PEM abandi badashobora kwandikamo."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "For the pinned mode: base64 SHA-256 of the BMC public key, as sha256//... or the bare hash. A changed key fails until this is updated."
msgstr "Ku buryo bw'urufunguzo rufashwe: SHA-256 muri base64 y'urufunguzo rusange rwa BMC, nka sha256//... cyangwa hash yonyine. Urufunguzo rwahindutse rurananirwa kugeza igihe ibi bivuguruwe."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "Public Key Pin"
msgstr "Pini y'urufunguzo rusange"

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "Allow Basic Authentication Fallback"
msgstr "Emera isimbura ry'iyemeza rya Basic"

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "Used only when the BMC offers no session service. Every request then carries the password; the health page warns while it is in use."
msgstr "Bikoreshwa gusa iyo BMC itanga nta serivisi y'isomo (session). Buri busabe icyo gihe buba bujyanye ijambobanga; urupapuro rw'ubuzima rutanga umuburo igihe birimo gukoreshwa."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "The Cacti device of the server this BMC manages. Leave it at none to have the plugin create a device from the list."
msgstr "Igikoresho cya Cacti cya seriveri iyi BMC iyobora. Bireke kuri nta na kimwe kugira ngo umugereka uhange igikoresho uvanye ku rutonde."

