msgstr "Umwirondoro mushya wa Redfish"

#: lib/CredentialsPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "Redfish Credential: %s"
msgstr "Umwirondoro wa Redfish: %s"

#: lib/CredentialsPage.php
msgid "A BMC account with the ReadOnly role. The plugin never needs a role that can change BMC state."
msgstr "Konti ya BMC ifite uruhare rwa ReadOnly. Umugereka ntukenera na rimwe uruhare rushobora guhindura imiterere ya BMC."

#: lib/CredentialsPage.php
msgid "A password is stored. Leave blank to keep it."
msgstr "Ijambobanga rirabitswe. Hasige harimo ubusa kugira ngo urigumane."

#: lib/CredentialsPage.php
msgid "Stored encrypted with the vault key."
msgstr "Byabitswe bisobetse hakoreshejwe urufunguzo rw'ububiko."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The Redfish templates are not installed completely. Reinstall them from the Redfish BMCs page."
msgstr "Inyandikorugero za Redfish ntizinjijwe neza zose. Ongera uzinjize uvuye ku rupapuro rwa Za BMC za Redfish."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "A device \"%s\" from the %s device template, polled by poller %d, with availability checks off. Its host name is a reserved name that is never contacted."
msgstr "Igikoresho \"%s\" giturutse ku nyandikorugero y'igikoresho %s, gikusanywa na poller %d, kandi igenzura ryo kuboneka rifunze. Izina ryacyo rya mudasobwa ni izina ryihariye ritigera rihamagarwa."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "The data query \"%s\", with a graph for each of the %d members known now."
msgstr "Ikibazo cy'amakuru \"%s\", gifite igishushanyo kuri buri wese mu banyamuryango %d bazwi ubu."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d fans or power supplies that were present are no longer reported. They count as failed until you confirm; confirming accepts the members the BMC reports now."
msgstr "Ibyuma bihuhura umuyaga cyangwa ibitanga umuriro %d byari bihari ntibikigaragara muri raporo. Bibarwa nk'ibyangiritse kugeza igihe wemeje; kwemeza byemera abanyamuryango BMC igaragaza ubu."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "The graph \"%s\", with its \"%s\" data source."
msgstr "Igishushanyo \"%s\", hamwe n'isoko yacyo y'amakuru \"%s\"."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The BMC is already mapped to a device."
msgstr "BMC isanzwe ihujwe n'igikoresho."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "Created by the Redfish plugin for BMC %s. Its values come from the plugin cache; the host name is a reserved name that is never contacted."
msgstr "Byahanzwe n'umugereka wa Redfish kuri BMC %s. Agaciro kayo gaturuka mu bubiko bw'agateganyo bw'umugereka; izina rya mudasobwa ni izina ryihariye ritigera rihamagarwa."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "Cacti refused to create the device. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Cacti yanze guhanga igikoresho. Reba inyandiko-mvugo ya Cacti."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The new device would be hidden from you by your device permissions, so it was removed again. Ask an administrator to grant access, or map the BMC to a device you can see."
msgstr "Igikoresho gishya cyari kuba gihishwe kuri wowe n'uburenganzira bwawe bw'ibikoresho, bityo cyakuweho. Saba umuyobozi kuguha uburenganzira, cyangwa uhuze BMC n'igikoresho ushobora kubona."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The BMC was mapped to a device by someone else meanwhile, or could not be mapped, so the new device was removed again. Reload the page and check its mapping."
msgstr "Hagati aho BMC yahujwe n'igikoresho n'undi muntu, cyangwa ntiyashoboye guhuzwa, bityo igikoresho gishya cyakuweho. Ongera utangize urupapuro kandi ugenzure ihuzwa ryacyo."

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Redfish templates could not be installed: %s"
msgstr "Inyandikorugero za Redfish ntizashoboye kwinjizwa: %s"

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
msgid "The Redfish templates are not installed or not current. Reinstall them from the Redfish BMCs page."
msgstr "Inyandikorugero za Redfish ntizinjijwe cyangwa ntizigezweho. Ongera uzinjize uvuye ku rupapuro rwa Za BMC za Redfish."

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: its Cacti device was deleted. Map it to another device or create one from the BMCs page."
msgstr "%s: igikoresho cyayo cya Cacti cyarasibwe. Gihuze n'ikindi gikoresho cyangwa uhange igishya uvuye ku rupapuro rwa za BMC."

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: its device is polled by poller %d but the BMC is read by poller %d. Move one of them so both use the same poller, or its graphs can read as unknown."
msgstr "%s: igikoresho cyayo gikusanywa na poller %d ariko BMC isomwa na poller %d. Imura kimwe muri byo kugira ngo byombi bikoreshe poller imwe, bitabaye ibyo ibishushanyo byayo bishobora kugaragara nk'ibitazwi."

