#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Credential Vault"
msgstr "Ububiko bw'ibanga bw'ibyangombwa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Vault Key File"
msgstr "Dosiye y'urufunguzo rw'ububiko bw'ibanga"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the 32-byte key that encrypts stored BMC passwords. Create it yourself, outside the web root, readable only by the web server and poller user, in a directory that only root and that user can write; the plugin never creates or writes it. Back it up with the database: without it, stored passwords must be entered again."
msgstr "Inzira yuzuye igana ku rufunguzo rwa bayite 32 rusobeka amagambobanga ya BMC abitswe. Yiremere wowe ubwawe, hanze y'umuzi w'urubuga, isomwa gusa na seriveri y'urubuga n'ukoresha poller, mu bubiko bw'amadosiye root n'uwo mukoresha bonyine bashobora kwandikamo; umugereka ntutigera ururema cyangwa ngo urwandike. Rwubikire hamwe n'ububiko bw'amakuru: udafite urwo rufunguzo, amagambobanga abitswe agomba kongera kwandikwa."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector"
msgstr "Igikusanyamakuru"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection Interval"
msgstr "Intera y'ikusanya"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds between reads of each BMC."
msgstr "Amasegonda ari hagati y'isomwa rya buri BMC."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Rediscovery Interval"
msgstr "Intera yo kongera gutahura"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds between full resource discoveries of each BMC. A BMC is also rediscovered at once when a known resource disappears or changes type."
msgstr "Amasegonda ari hagati y'itahura ryuzuye ry'ibikoresho bya buri BMC. BMC inatahuriwa ako kanya iyo igikoresho kizwi kibuze cyangwa gihinduye ubwoko."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector Time Budget"
msgstr "Igihe cyagenewe igikusanyamakuru"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one collector run may spend before it stops starting new BMCs. Keep it below the poller interval; unfinished BMCs resume on the next run."
msgstr "Amasegonda ikorwa rimwe ry'umukusanya rishobora kumara mbere y'uko rihagarika gutangira za BMC nshya. Bigumane munsi y'intera ya poller; za BMC zitarangiye zikomeza ku ikorwa rikurikira."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "BMCs read in parallel. Each BMC is read by one worker at a time."
msgstr "Za BMC zisomwa icyarimwe. Buri BMC isomwa n'umukozi (worker) umwe icyarimwe."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector Workers"
msgstr "Abakozi b'umukusanya"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Connect Timeout"
msgstr "Igihe ntarengwa cyo kwihuza"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds allowed for the TCP connection and TLS handshake to a BMC."
msgstr "Amasegonda yemewe ku kwihuza kwa TCP n'igenzura ry'itangira rya TLS kuri BMC."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Request Timeout"
msgstr "Igihe ntarengwa cy'ubusabe"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds allowed for one whole request to a BMC, including the connection."
msgstr "Amasegonda yemewe ku busabe bumwe bwuzuye kuri BMC, harimo n'ukwihuza."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "KiB accepted in one BMC response body; a larger response is refused."
msgstr "KiB zemewe mu gihimba kimwe cy'igisubizo cya BMC; igisubizo kinini kurushaho kirangwa."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Response Size"
msgstr "Ingano ntarengwa y'igisubizo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Freshness"
msgstr "Ubushyashya bw'amakuru"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection intervals after which a reading is shown as delayed."
msgstr "Intera zo gukusanya zishira igipimo kikagaragazwa nk'icyatinze."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Delayed After"
msgstr "Cyatinze nyuma ya"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection intervals after which a reading is stale and reads as unknown. Always at least one more than Delayed After."
msgstr "Intera zo gukusanya zishira igipimo kikaba cyashaje kandi kigasomwa nk'ikitazwi. Buri gihe kigomba kuba kirenze nibura rimwe kuri Cyatinze nyuma ya."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Stale After"
msgstr "Bita agaciro nyuma ya"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Kura muri sisitemu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Gumisha imbonerahamwe z'umugereka igihe ukurwa muri sisitemu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its BMC registry, encrypted passwords, and reading cache. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them. Uninstall never touches Cacti devices, graphs, or BMCs, including devices the plugin created."
msgstr "Iyo bihiswemo, gukuramo umugereka bigumana urutonde rwawo rwa BMC, amagambobanga asobetse, n'ububiko bw'agateganyo bw'ibipimo. Bikureho kugira ngo gukuramo umugereka bibisibe. Gukuramo umugereka ntibikora ku bikoresho bya Cacti, ibishushanyo, cyangwa za BMC, harimo n'ibikoresho umugereka wahanze."

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Verify against the system CA store"
msgstr "Genzura ukoresheje ububiko bwa CA bwa sisitemu"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Verify against a CA bundle file"
msgstr "Genzura ukoresheje idosiye y'ishami rya CA"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Pinned public key (SHA-256)"
msgstr "Urufunguzo rusange rufashwe (SHA-256)"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Do not verify (unsafe)"
msgstr "Ntugenzure (ntibifite umutekano)"

