#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "Backoff and held failures were cleared; the collector reads the BMC on its next run."
msgstr "Gutegereza n'amakosa yari afashwe byahanaguwe; umukusanya asoma BMC ku ikorwa rye rikurikira."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "Adding devices and graphs needs Cacti's device management permission."
msgstr "Kongeraho ibikoresho n'ibishushanyo bisaba uburenganzira bwa Cacti bwo gucunga ibikoresho."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The device of this BMC was deleted. Choose another device, or none, on the BMC form first."
msgstr "Igikoresho cy'iyi BMC cyarasibwe. Hitamo ikindi gikoresho, cyangwa nta na kimwe, ku ifishi ya BMC mbere."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
#, php-format
